Template: minipgagent/use-existing-config
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Use the settings of the earlier MiniPG agent installation?
 This host still has the settings an earlier minipgagent installation left:
 ${found}
 .
 Keeping them leaves the agents as they were (start each with: systemctl
 enable --now minipgagent@<instance>). Otherwise they are moved, sudo rules
 included, to /etc/bfm/backup/ and the example settings are installed;
 minipgagent setup then starts from scratch. PostgreSQL is not touched either
 way.
